	Title: "Daedalus Armor (Ranged)"
	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Daedalus Armor (Ranged). 48 defense (14 / 19 / 15). Getting hit causes you to emit a blast of crystal shards. How to get it: Daedalus Headgear: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 12 Cryonic Bar; Daedalus Breastplate: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 24 Cryonic Bar, 6 Frigid Bar; Daedalus Leggings: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 18 Cryonic Bar, 4 Frigid Bar"
	Tooltip: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Daedalus Armor (Ranged): 48 defense (14 / 19 / 15)"
