	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Daedalus Armor (Rogue). 44 defense (10 / 19 / 15). +X maximum stealth. Rogue projectiles throw out crystal shards as they travel. How to get it: Daedalus Facemask: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 12 Cryonic Bar; Daedalus Breastplate: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 24 Cryonic Bar, 6 Frigid Bar; Daedalus Leggings: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 18 Cryonic Bar, 4 Frigid Bar"
