GearSetcalamitymodstatigelsummon: {
	Title: "Statigel Armor (Summon)"
	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Statigel Armor (Summon). 22 defense (4 / 10 / 8). 15% increased summon damage. Summons a mini paladin to fight for you, the type depends on what world evil you have. Grants an extra jump and increased jump height. X% increased jump speed. How to get it: Statigel Hood: Craft at Solidifier from 8 Purified Gel, 8 Blighted Gel; Statigel Armor: Craft at Solidifier from 12 Purified Gel, 12 Blighted Gel, 6 Goopwood; Statigel Greaves: Craft at Solidifier from 10 Purified Gel, 10 Blighted Gel, 5 Goopwood"
	Tooltip: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Statigel Armor (Summon): 22 defense (4 / 10 / 8)"
}

GearSetcalamitymodtitanheart: {
	Title: "Titan Heart Armor"
	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Titan Heart Armor. 32 defense (8 / 14 / 10). +X maximum stealth. Stealth strikes deal 2x knockback and cause an astral explosion. Grants immunity to knockback. How to get it: Titan Heart Mask: Craft at Anvil from 10 Astral Monolith, 1 Titan Heart; Titan Heart Mantle: Craft at Anvil from 20 Astral Monolith, 1 Titan Heart; Titan Heart Boots: Craft at Anvil from 14 Astral Monolith, 1 Titan Heart"
	Tooltip: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Titan Heart Armor: 32 defense (8 / 14 / 10)"
}

GearSetcalamitymodastral: {
	Title: "Astral Armor"
	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Astral Armor. 63 defense (17 / 25 / 21). Increases your max number of minions by 3. 10% increased damage and critical strike chance. Whenever you crit an enemy, a barrage of stars will rain down. This effect has a 1 second cooldown before it can trigger again. How to get it: Astral Helm: Craft at Ancient Manipulator from 12 Astral Bar, 3 Phase Bar; Astral Breastplate: Craft at Ancient Manipulator from 24 Astral Bar, 6 Phase Bar; Astral Leggings: Craft at Ancient Manipulator from 18 Astral Bar, 4 Phase Bar"
	Tooltip: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Astral Armor: 63 defense (17 / 25 / 21)"
}

GearSetcalamitymodbrimflame: {
	Title: "Brimflame Armor"
	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Brimflame Armor. 41 defense (12 / 16 / 13). 8% increased magic damage and critical strike chance. Brimflame Frenzy - X for 10 seconds of 40% increased magic damage. However, this inflicts rapid life loss and disables mana regeneration and mana potions. This effect can be toggled off and has a cooldown of 30 seconds. How to get it: Brimflame Cowl: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 8 Unholy Core, 4 Ashes of Calamity; Brimflame Robes: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 12 Unholy Core, 8 Ashes of Calamity; Brimflame Boots: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 10 Unholy Core, 6 Ashes of Calamity"
	Tooltip: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Brimflame Armor: 41 defense (12 / 16 / 13)"
}

GearSetcalamitymodfathomswarmer: {
	Title: "Fathom Swarmer Armor"
	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Fathom Swarmer Armor. 41 defense (8 / 20 / 13). Increases your max number of minions by 2. 10% increased summon damage. Grants the ability to climb walls. 20% increased summon damage, +10 defense and +2.5 HP/s life regen while underwater. Provides a moderate amount of light and moderately reduces breath loss in the abyss. How to get it: Fathom Swarmer Visage: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 6 Sea Remains, 25 Planty Mush, 10 Depth Cells; Fathom Swarmer Breastplate: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 12 Sea Remains, 75 Planty Mush, 20 Depth Cells; Fathom Swarmer Greaves: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 9 Sea Remains, 50 Planty Mush, 15 Depth Cells"
	Tooltip: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Fathom Swarmer Armor: 41 defense (8 / 20 / 13)"
}

GearSetcalamitymodhydrothermicmagic: {
	Title: "Hydrothermic Armor (Magic)"
	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Hydrothermic Armor (Magic). 43 defense (9 / 20 / 14). Magic attacks summon damaging and healing flare orbs on hit. Inferno effect when below 50% life. You emit a blazing explosion when you are hit. How to get it: Hydrothermic Mask: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 10 Scoria Bar; Hydrothermic Armor: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 20 Scoria Bar; Hydrothermic Subligar: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 15 Scoria Bar"
