GearSetcalamitymodluniccorps: {
	Title: "Lunic Corps Armor"
	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Lunic Corps Armor. 56 defense (14 / 24 / 18). Halves Adrenaline lost on hit if the shield fully absorbs the hit. X% increased jump speed. MJOLNIR Shield - Projects a bubble shield that absorbs up to 50 damageX. The shield starts recharging 5 seconds after being hit. Recharging from zero to full charge takes 2 seconds. Being hit again while recharging restarts the charge timer. 'Finish the fight'. How to get it: Lunic Corps Helmet: Craft at Ancient Manipulator from 1 Night Vision Helmet, 6 Astral Bar, 6 Chlorophyte Bar, 20 Glass; Lunic Corps Vest: Craft at Ancient Manipulator from 1 Rover Drive, 11 Astral Bar, 11 Chlorophyte Bar; Lunic Corps Boots: Craft at Ancient Manipulator from 8 Astral Bar, 8 Chlorophyte Bar"
	Tooltip: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Lunic Corps Armor: 56 defense (14 / 24 / 18)"
}

GearSetcalamitymodplaguereaper: {
	Title: "Plague Reaper Armor"
	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Plague Reaper Armor. 44 defense (11 / 19 / 14). 5% increased flight time. Enemies afflicted by the Plague take 1.1x damage from ranged projectiles. Plague Blackout - X to greatly empower your damage but completely blind yourself. 60% increased ranged damage and 20% increased ranged critical strike chance while blacked out. This effect lasts 5 seconds and has a cooldown of 25 seconds. How to get it: Plague Reaper Mask: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 1 Necro Helmet, 15 Plague Cell Canister, 11 Nanites (+1 alternative recipe); Plague Reaper Vest: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 1 Necro Breastplate, 29 Plague Cell Canister, 19 Nanites; Plague Reaper Striders: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 1 Necro Greaves, 21 Plague Cell Canister, 17 Nanites"
	Tooltip: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Plague Reaper Armor: 44 defense (11 / 19 / 14)"
}

GearSetcalamitymodplaguebringer: {
	Title: "Plaguebringer Armor"
	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Plaguebringer Armor. 32 defense (9 / 13 / 10). Grants a plague dash which can slam through enemies without taking damage. Summons a lil' plaguebringer which swarms your foes with little bees. Friendly bees inflict Plague. How to get it: Plaguebringer Visor: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 1 Bee Headgear, 4 Infected Armor Plating, 4 Plague Cell Canister; Plaguebringer Carapace: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 1 Bee Breastplate, 2 Alchemical Decanter, 7 Infected Armor Plating, 7 Plague Cell Canister; Plaguebringer Pistons: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 1 Bee Greaves, 1 Flower Boots, 5 Infected Armor Plating, 5 Plague Cell Canister"
	Tooltip: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Plaguebringer Armor: 32 defense (9 / 13 / 10)"
}

