	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Reaver Armor (Headgear). 48 defense (6 / 24 / 18). Emits light and shows the location of treasure and ore. Enemies are less likely to target you and grants underwater breathing. Greatly enhances visibility in the abyss. Increased block placement & tool range by 7. Increases pickup range for items. How to get it: Reaver Headgear: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 10 Perennial Bar; Reaver Scale Mail: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 20 Perennial Bar; Reaver Cuisses: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 15 Perennial Bar"
