	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Reaver Armor (Visage). 55 defense (13 / 24 / 18). Grants immunity to fall damage and allows constant jumping. 10% increased flight time and horizontal wing speed. Grappling hooks retract and pull the player 50% faster. Reduces the cooldown of dashes by 33.33%. How to get it: Reaver Visage: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 10 Perennial Bar; Reaver Scale Mail: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 20 Perennial Bar; Reaver Cuisses: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 15 Perennial Bar"
