GearSetcalamitymodbloodflaremelee: {
	Title: "Bloodflare Armor (Melee)"
	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Bloodflare Armor (Melee). 108 defense (44 / 36 / 28). Enemies are more likely to target you. After striking an enemy 15 times with true melee you will enter a blood frenzy for 5 seconds. During this you will gain 25% increased melee damage, critical strike chance, and 50% reduced contact damage. This effect has a 30 second cooldown. Enemies below 50% life drop a heart when struck. This effect has a 5 second cooldown. How to get it: Bloodflare Ram Mask: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 25 Bloodstone, 10 Blood Orb, 2 Ruinous Soul; Bloodflare Body Armor: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 50 Bloodstone, 20 Blood Orb, 4 Ruinous Soul; Bloodflare Cuisses: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 35 Bloodstone, 15 Blood Orb, 3 Ruinous Soul"
