	Title: "Omega Blue Armor"
	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Omega Blue Armor. 50 defense (15 / 20 / 15). Increases your max number of minions by 2. Short-ranged tentacles heal you by sucking enemy life. Abyssal Madness - X to go berserk for 5 seconds. While active, tentacles attack with greater range and aggression, and always critically strike. This also grants 10% increased damage and critical strike chance. This effect has a 25 second cooldown. How to get it: Omega Blue Helmet: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 3 Reaper Tooth, 15 Depth Cells, 1 Ruinous Soul; Omega Blue Chestplate: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 5 Reaper Tooth, 25 Depth Cells, 3 Ruinous Soul; Omega Blue Tentacles: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 4 Reaper Tooth, 20 Depth Cells, 2 Ruinous Soul"
