	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Auric Tesla Armor (Ranged). 125 defense (39 / 44 / 42). Ranged Tarragon, Bloodflare and God Slayer armor effects. Hold Shift to view these set bonus details and press Shift repeatedly to cycle through them. How to get it: Auric Tesla Hooded Facemask: Craft at Cosmic Anvil from 1 God Slayer Helmet, 1 Bloodflare Demon Helm, 1 Tarragon Visage, 10 Auric Bar; Auric Tesla Body Armor: Craft at Cosmic Anvil from 1 God Slayer Chestplate, 1 Bloodflare Body Armor, 1 Tarragon Breastplate, 20 Auric Bar (+1 alternative recipe); Auric Tesla Cuisses: Craft at Cosmic Anvil from 1 God Slayer Leggings, 1 Bloodflare Cuisses, 1 Tarragon Leggings, 1 Flying Carpet, 15 Auric Bar (+1 alternative recipe)"
	Tooltip: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Auric Tesla Armor (Ranged): 125 defense (39 / 44 / 42)"
}

