GearSetcalamitymodfearmonger: {
	Title: "Fearmonger Armor"
	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Fearmonger Armor. 125 defense (35 / 48 / 42). Increases your max number of minions by 2. Minions no longer deal less damage while wielding non-summoner weapons. Immunity to all but the strongest forms of frost and flame. Minion attacks grant +2.5 HP/s life regen and massively accelerate life regen. How to get it: Fearmonger Greathelm: Craft at Cosmic Anvil from 1 Spooky Helmet, 8 Cosmilite Bar, 2 Ascendant Spirit Essence, 8 Soul of Fright; Fearmonger Plate Mail: Craft at Cosmic Anvil from 1 Spooky Breastplate, 12 Cosmilite Bar, 3 Ascendant Spirit Essence, 12 Soul of Fright; Fearmonger Greaves: Craft at Cosmic Anvil from 1 Spooky Leggings, 10 Cosmilite Bar, 2 Ascendant Spirit Essence, 10 Soul of Fright"
	Tooltip: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Fearmonger Armor: 125 defense (35 / 48 / 42)"
}

GearSetcalamitymodgemtech: {
	Title: "Gem Tech Armor"
	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Gem Tech Armor. 69 defense (14 / 31 / 24). Power Gems - Six gem fragments idly orbit you; one for each class, and a base gem. How to get it: Gem Tech Headgear: Craft at Draedons Forge from 10 Exo Prism, 5 Solar Fragment, 5 Vortex Fragment, 5 Nebula Fragment, 5 Stardust Fragment, 5 Meld Blob, 2 Core of Calamity; Gem Tech Body Armor: Craft at Draedons Forge from 16 Exo Prism, 5 Solar Fragment, 5 Vortex Fragment, 5 Nebula Fragment, 5 Stardust Fragment, 5 Meld Blob, 2 Core of Calamity; Gem Tech Schynbaulds: Craft at Draedons Forge from 12 Exo Prism, 4 Solar Fragment, 4 Vortex Fragment, 4 Nebula Fragment, 4 Stardust Fragment, 4 Meld Blob, 2 Core of Calamity"
	Tooltip: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Gem Tech Armor: 69 defense (14 / 31 / 24)"
}

GearSetcalamitymodgodslayermelee: {
	Title: "God Slayer Armor (Melee)"
	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full God Slayer Armor (Melee). 120 defense (50 / 40 / 30). Enemies are more likely to target you. Releases a swarm of god killer darts when taking over 80 damage in one hit. Press X to Dimensional Drive towards your cursor for 1.25 seconds. Enemies you dash through take massive damage. During Dimensional Drive you are immune to damage and most debuffs. Dimensional Drive has a X second cooldown. How to get it: God Slayer Horned Greathelm: Craft at Cosmic Anvil from 10 Cosmilite Bar, 2 Ascendant Spirit Essence; God Slayer Chestplate: Craft at Cosmic Anvil from 20 Cosmilite Bar, 4 Ascendant Spirit Essence; God Slayer Leggings: Craft at Cosmic Anvil from 15 Cosmilite Bar, 3 Ascendant Spirit Essence"
	Tooltip: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] God Slayer Armor (Melee): 120 defense (50 / 40 / 30)"
}

