GearSetsotstwilightassassin: {
	Title: "Twilight Assassin Armor"
	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Twilight Assassin Armor. 27 defense (8 / 10 / 9). The Holo Eye now automatically attacks for you. Automatic attacks have a 25% chance to destabilize enemies, but the chance of applying it gets lower with each level already applied. How to get it: Twilight Assassin Circlet: Craft at Hardlight Fabricator from 12 Starlight Alloy, 12 Hardlight Alloy, 1 Dissolving Aether, 4 Purified Gel; Found in world-generated chests; Twilight Assassin Chestplate: Craft at Hardlight Fabricator from 6 Hellstone Bar, 20 Hardlight Alloy, 1 Dissolving Aether, 6 Purified Gel; Found in world-generated chests; Twilight Assassin Leggings: Craft at Hardlight Fabricator from 12 Twilight Alloy, 16 Hardlight Alloy, 1 Dissolving Aether, 5 Purified Gel; Found in world-generated chests"
