	Title: "Elemental Armor"
	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Elemental Armor. 60 defense (18 / 24 / 18). Enemies hit by the teleport will be frozen in time temporarily. Decreases cooldown on the teleport to 6 seconds and increases the range enemies will take damage from the teleport by 50%. Increases teleport damage based on void damage modifiers. How to get it: Elemental Helmet: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 15 Phase Bar, 10 Fragment of Chaos, 1 Twilight Assassin Circlet, 4 Scoria Bar; Elemental Breastplate: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 20 Phase Bar, 10 Fragment of Chaos, 1 Twilight Assassin Chestplate, 1 Blink Pack, 6 Scoria Bar (+1 alternative recipe); Elemental Leggings: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 10 Phase Bar, 10 Fragment of Chaos, 1 Twilight Assassin Leggings, 5 Scoria Bar"
