GearSetsotsvoidspacerangers: {
	Title: "Voidspace Ranger's Armor"
	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Voidspace Ranger's Armor. 60 defense (16 / 24 / 20). Attacks permanently inflict the Subspace Flames debuff, which deals 10 damage per second. When an enemy with Subspace Flames is killed, they deal damage to all other enemies equal to the cumulative damage they took from Subspace Flames. Enemies that take damage this way will also be inflicted with Subspace Flames. How to get it: Voidspace Ranger's Mask: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 15 Sanguite Scales, 10 Fragment of Inferno, 1 Vespera Mask, 4 Astral Bar; Voidspace Ranger's Breastplate: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 20 Sanguite Scales, 10 Fragment of Inferno, 1 Vespera Breastplate, 6 Astral Bar; Voidspace Ranger's Leggings: Craft at Mythril/Orichalcum Anvil from 10 Sanguite Scales, 10 Fragment of Inferno, 1 Vespera Leggings, 5 Astral Bar"
