	Contents: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Wear the full Stardust Armor. Head armor, Body armor, Leg armor. A Stardust Guardian protects you and attacks nearby enemies. How to get it: Stardust Helmet: Craft at the Ancient Manipulator from Luminite Bars and Stardust Fragments; Stardust Plate: Craft at the Ancient Manipulator from Luminite Bars and Stardust Fragments; Stardust Leggings: Craft at the Ancient Manipulator from Luminite Bars and Stardust Fragments"
	Tooltip: "[c/E0B14A:Armor set] Stardust Armor: Head armor, Body armor, Leg armor"
}
